025741#post1025741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember that the Hollow Earth was supposed to be on the near side of the Gauntlet. That leaves me to wonder whether it has a spiritual aspect at all. Where does one wind up if one steps sidewise in the Hollow Earth? If the answer isn't simple, fera wouldn't like it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It can be ACCESSED from the near side of the Gauntlet (via certain deep crevices into the earth, particularly at the poles). That doesn't mean the realm itself is. IIRC, the dominant Etherite theory is that it's in the Shard Realm of Matter. In that &quot;universe&quot;, the infinity of space is solid earth instead of vacuum, and corresponding to the locations of the planets are the &quot;hollow&quot; spherical spaces with mini-stars at their center and gravity pulling out toward the walls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}